  - id: the_rest_that_remaineth
    displayName: The Rest That Remaineth
    flavorText: God swears in his wrath that the unbelieving wilderness generation
      will never enter his rest, and the author warns his readers today not to harden
      their hearts the same way.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Warns readers, using the wilderness generation's failure as a cautionary
      type, not to let unbelief keep them from entering God's promised rest the way
      hardened hearts kept that generation out of Canaan, and holds out a rest that
      still remains open to be entered by faith.
    deliveredByManagerId: 
    managerId: wilderness_rest_hebrews
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
    baseCost: 98.8361533115748
    costGrowthRate: 1.15
