  - id: the_greater_tabernacle
    displayName: The Greater Tabernacle
    flavorText: Christ obtains a more excellent ministry as mediator of a better
      covenant, one grounded in Jeremiah's own promise of a new covenant written
      not on tablets but on the heart.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Contrasts the earthly tabernacle's repeated animal sacrifices, which
      could only cleanse the flesh, with Christ's single once-for-all self-offering
      in the heavenly sanctuary, and grounds the new covenant in Jeremiah's own prophecy
      of a covenant written on the heart rather than on tablets.
    deliveredByManagerId: 
    managerId: greater_tabernacle_hebrews
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
    baseCost: 9654.893846056293
    costGrowthRate: 1.15
    baseInkPerSecond: 482.74469230281466
    unlockAtVerseIndex: 171
    managerName: 
    managerFlavorText: 
