    managerBonusMultiplier: 0.25
    managerUnlockCost: 0
    submanagers: []
  - id: the_great_cloud_of_witnesses
    displayName: The Great Cloud of Witnesses
    flavorText: Faith is the substance of things hoped for and the evidence of things
      not seen, and by it the elders of old obtained a good report though most of
      them never lived to see the promise fulfilled.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Catalogues Old Testament figures whose faith held onto God's promises
      without seeing them fulfilled, encouraging a persecuted audience to keep faith
      and endurance despite their own unfulfilled hope, closing on the point that
      these witnesses are, in a real sense, still waiting alongside the readers.
    deliveredByManagerId: 
    managerId: cloud_of_witnesses_hebrews
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
    baseCost: 30353.265475060376
    costGrowthRate: 1.15
    baseInkPerSecond: 1517.6632737530188
    unlockAtVerseIndex: 199
    managerName: 
    managerFlavorText: 
    managerUnlockLevel: 0
    managerUnlockAtVerseIndex: 0
    managerBonusMultiplier: 0.25
    managerUnlockCost: 0
    submanagers: []
  - id: mount_sinai_and_mount_zion
    displayName: Mount Sinai and Mount Zion
    flavorText: Rather than the untouchable, tempest-wrapped mountain that made even
      Moses tremble, believers have come instead to mount Sion, the heavenly Jerusalem,
      and to Jesus the mediator of a new covenant.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Contrasts the terrifying, untouchable mountain of the law's giving at
      Sinai with the joyful, accessible mount Sion of the new covenant, reinforcing
      a warning against turning back with a real cautionary example in Esau and the
      theme of divine discipline as evidence of true sonship.
    deliveredByManagerId: 
    managerId: mount_zion_hebrews
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
    baseCost: 95425.25683757997
    costGrowthRate: 1.15
